<title>NETHERLANDS: Labouchere raises Ten Cate to a Buy.</title>
<headline>Labouchere raises Ten Cate to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (30/05)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector-------------Price---Broker----------</p>
<p>Ten Cate	  textiles,plastics  105.00  Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold).</p>
<p>EPS forecasts and recommendation raised after analysts meeting at company. Denim activities still loss making but 1997 loss seen at two million guilders compared with 9.2 million in 1996. Company's positive points are low cash flow multiple, low price/book value and relative high yield. Convinced that Ten Cate has broken with tradition of negative surprises. 12-month price target 125 guilders.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     8.31		  10.0   3.00</p>
<p>    1997		 10.23     (9.79)   10.3   3.75</p>
<p>    1998		 11.67    (11.46)    9.0   4.40</p>
